1
00:00:00,124 --> 00:00:01,914
(Leonard:)That's not what she's doing, Leslie.

2
00:00:02,084 --> 00:00:05,674
She's trying to shore up her self-esteem.
It has nothing to do with sex.

3
00:00:05,838 --> 00:00:07,258
(Leslie:)Everything has to do with sex.

4
00:00:07,423 --> 00:00:10,173
(Howard:)Mm. Testify.

5
00:00:11,344 --> 00:00:13,014
(Leslie:)I'm not touching that.

6
00:00:15,681 --> 00:00:18,391
- Leslie, you are way off base here.
- Now, hang on, Leonard.

7
00:00:18,559 --> 00:00:22,609
(Sheldon:)While I have no respect for Leslie as a
scientist or a human being for that matter...

8
00:00:23,856 --> 00:00:26,196
(Sheldon:)...we have to concede
her undeniable expertise...

9
00:00:26,359 --> 00:00:30,859
(Sheldon:)...in the interrelated fields of promiscuity
and general sluttiness.

10
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,990
(Penny:)Thank you.

11
00:00:33,157 --> 00:00:36,197
(Leslie:)My point is that Tinkerbell
just needs to get her some.

12
00:00:36,577 --> 00:00:40,877
(Sheldon:)Some what?
Oh, yes, some sexual intercourse.

13
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:43,580
(Howard:)I'll take the bullet.

14
00:00:45,378 --> 00:00:49,548
- Excuse me, this whole idea's insane.
- Enough debate. I'm going to take action.

15
00:00:50,883 --> 00:00:52,343
(Gablehauser(as phone rings):)Excuse me.

16
00:00:52,510 --> 00:00:56,050
(Sheldon:)Are you currently involved
in a sexual relationship?

17
00:00:57,473 --> 00:01:01,023
(Sheldon:)- No.
- Would you like to be?

